      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow 03 — Baseline Diagnosis (measurement)\n\n**Automatic measurement of 01e hh.ru scanner metrics.**\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Schedule Trigger (8:25 AM) or Error Trigger catches 01e completion\n2. Fetch 01e execution data via n8n API (Get Many/Get One)\n3. Parse runData for per-node item counts\n4. Read Profile for snapshot\n5. Record baseline metrics to Airtable (if data valid)\n\n**Per D-09:** Does NOT record if zero results or errors occurred.\n**Modifies no workflow files.**",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 400
      },
